        "content": "<p>A starnge thing on master : just add <code>public import Mathlib.RingTheory.LocalRing.Module</code> to <code>Mathlib.RingTheory.KrullDimension.Regular</code>, the file would break, not knowing <code>maximalIdeal</code> in namespace <code>Module</code> even if openning <code>IsLocalRing</code></p>",
