    {
        "content": "<p>This topic was moved here from <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"287929\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/CI.20failure.20in.20unrelated.20file\">#mathlib4 &gt; CI failure in unrelated file</a> by <span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"749361\">Nailin Guan</span>.</p>",
        "id": 577733616,
        "sender_full_name": "Notification Bot",
        "timestamp": 1772798825
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The situation can be simplified to the following: we have namespace <code>A</code> <code>B</code>, in namespace <code>A</code> if we open <code>B</code>, we can use <code>foo</code> to represent <code>B.foo</code> iff there isn't such namespace <code>A.B</code>, open <code>B</code> out side <code>A</code> then nothing happens.</p>",
        "id": 577733952,
        "sender_full_name": "Nailin Guan",
        "timestamp": 1772798926
    }
